# Laugh API

This project provides a simple API endpoint that returns a random joke to make you laugh.

## Installation

1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/yourusername/laugh-api.git
   cd laugh-api
   ```

2. Install the required packages:
   ```bash
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   ```

## Usage

To run the application, execute:
```bash
python hello.py
```

The API will be available at `http://127.0.0.1:5000/laugh`.

## Testing

To run the tests, execute:
```bash
pytest test_hello.py
```

